{"type":"message","id":"8fbf0e31","parentId":"71990dbe","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:02:24.925Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-02-13 17:02 GMT+9] Fix issue #292: Implement Database Backups\n\n**Issue Details:**\n- Title: backend: Implement Automated Database Backups\n- Priority: high\n- Labels: backend, security, devops\n\n**Tasks:**\n1. Design backup strategy (daily, hourly, retention policies)\n2. Implement automated backup scripts\n3. Configure remote backup storage (S3, cloud storage)\n4. Add backup verification and restore testing\n5. Create monitoring alerts for backup failures\n\n**Approach:**\n- Create comprehensive backup scripts for PostgreSQL/MySQL\n- Implement incremental and full backup options\n- Set up scheduled cron jobs\n- Configure AWS S3 or equivalent storage\n- Implement backup encryption and rotation\n- Create restore procedures documentation\n\nPlease provide backup scripts and configuration details."}],"timestamp":1770969744922}}
{"type":"message","id":"99363f04","parentId":"8fbf0e31","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:02:37.219Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to implement database backups for issue #292. Let me first explore the workspace to understand the project structure and then create comprehensive backup scripts.\n\nI need to:\n1. Check the project structure\n2. Look for existing database configurations\n3. Create backup scripts for PostgreSQL/MySQL\n4. Create configuration files for S3 storage\n5. Set up backup verification\n6. Document restore procedures\n\nLet me start by exploring the workspace.","thinkingSignature":"63e0044d11b3c868d2d63249bd35a0a90706e77bb44d2d43d9ef6a951d7083de"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_45ymvipx4032_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_45ymvipx4032_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent -type f -name \"*.env\" -o -name \"*.yaml\" -o -name \"*.yml\" -o -name \"*.json\" 2>/dev/null | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":8,"output":213,"cacheRead":5047,"cacheWrite":3594,"totalTokens":8862,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770969744925}}
