{"type":"message","id":"9fe01e36","parentId":"7189bcc4","timestamp":"2026-02-13T08:07:22.077Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The backup system is complete. Let me provide a summary.","thinkingSignature":"74d2861b5543461fd9a12f685846414b6592d9a3f22b0f49120e136e2bc96647"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n## ✅ Database Backup System Implemented\n\nCreated comprehensive backup system at `/Users/yu-ga/.clawdbot/agents/monetize-agent/backups/`:\n\n### Files Created\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `config/backup.conf` | Central configuration |\n| `scripts/backup_full.sh` | Full PostgreSQL backup (pg_dump) |\n| `scripts/backup_incremental.sh` | Incremental backup (pg_basebackup) |\n| `scripts/verify_backups.sh` | Checksum verification + restore testing |\n| `scripts/restore_database.sh` | Database restore utility |\n| `scripts/run_backup.sh` | Orchestrates all backups |\n| `scripts/backup_setup.sh` | Cron job generator |\n| `scripts/healthcheck.sh` | Health monitoring |\n| `README.md` | Usage documentation |\n| `RESTORE_PROCEDURES.md` | Recovery guide |\n| `.env.example` | Environment template |\n| `docker-compose.test.yml` | Local testing with MinIO |\n| `Dockerfile.backup` | Backup container image |\n\n### Features\n\n- **Encryption**: AES-256 GPG encryption for backups\n- **S3 Storage**: AWS S3 + S3-compatible (MinIO, DigitalOcean, etc.)\n- **Retention**: 30-day daily, 8-week weekly, 12-month monthly\n- **Verification**: SHA256 checksums + test restores\n- **Alerts**: Slack webhook + email support\n- **Cron**: Daily full + 6-hour incremental schedule\n\n### Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Configure environment\ncp backups/.env.example backups/.env\n# Edit DATABASE_URL and S3 credentials\n\n# 2. Generate encryption key\nopenssl rand -base64 32 > backups/config/backup.key\nchmod 600 backups/config/backup.key\n\n# 3. Run backup\nnpm run backup:full\n\n# 4. List/restore backups\nnpm run backup:list\nnpm run backup:latest\n```\n\n### npm Scripts Added\n\n- `npm run backup:full` / `backup:inc` / `backup:run`\n- `npm run backup:verify` / `backup:list` / `backup:latest`\n\n### Cron Installation\n\n```bash\n./backups/scripts/backup_setup.sh | crontab -\n```\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":18170,"output":499,"cacheRead":8465,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27134,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1770970031825}}
